  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support the control and Elimination of Trachoma</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribute to the global goal  of reducing the burden of targeted NTDs so that they are no longer a public health problem
TT surgeries, distribute antibiotics and azithromycin and tetracycline
Targeted IEC and BCC campaigns in endemic areas.</narrative>
  </description>
